WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.770
Here is one defensible direction for the healthcare
case Diagnosis

00:00:05.796 --> 00:00:11.443
code is nominal Pain score is ordinal Celsius
temperature

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:17.141
is interval Age is ratio Comorbidity count is a
discrete

00:00:17.154 --> 00:00:24.690
ratio count Length of stay is measured time and is
usually treated as ratio Ordered

00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:30.075
bars work well for pain score A histogram or box
plot can reveal skew and

00:00:30.101 --> 00:00:36.014
outliers in length of stay Diagnosis codes should
generally be represented

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:38.751
categorically rather than as arbitrary numbers
